{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "UBCZ4MQTEW2PWB2GYJGGILW5YFX36FII",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041141007",
    "title": "運命の声へ跳べ！",
    "enTitle": "Go Forth with the Voice of Fate!",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "うおおおおお！！　ラストスパーーーーート！！",
            "enText": "Uwoooooooh!! Last Spuuuuuuuuuurt!!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 188,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": 1874942080580100230
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -490029773404217456,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "んーーーっ！！\n山の空気は気持ちいいな、トレーナー！",
            "enText": "Mmmm---!! \nThe mountain air feels great, Trainer!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 194,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 100,
                    "pathId": 1680187843837304467
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 70,
                    "pathId": -2122963317265801106
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6373631566426114782,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "あれ、トレーナー？　どこに行ったんだ？",
            "enText": "Huh, Trainer? Where did you go?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ぜぇ、ぜぇ……なんでいきなり登山……？",
                    "enText": "……Why are we mountain climbing……?",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": 2259608618908302015
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1702882165850819309
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3245664458280954113,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "もちろん、脚力と持久力を鍛えるためさ！\n運命の声も、とことん負荷をかけろって言ってくれたしな！",
            "enText": "Of course, to build leg strength and endurance! \nSince the Voice of Fate told me to push myself as hard as possible!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 266,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": 1012557395093527755
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7096259510028717227
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3510994797579715924,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "夏合宿でもエピファネイアは絶好調だった。\n運命の声の後押しを受け、突如遠泳に行くわ、山に登り始めるわ。",
            "enText": "Epiphaneia was in top form even during the summer training \ncamp. After hearing the Voice of Fate, we had gone for a \nlong-distance swim and then went mountain climbing.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 95,
                    "pathId": 8778999809202735860
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3110128135889323198
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 526898879074254253,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "幸いなのは、彼女が自分のことを置いていかず、\n必ず連れていってくれることだ。",
            "enText": "The only saving grace was that she wasn't \nleaving me behind, she was making sure I kept up.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（……俺も俺で、できることをしよう！）",
                    "enText": "(……I'll just do what I can!)",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（……私も私で、できることをしよう！）",
                    "enText": "(……I'll just do what I can!)",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 6664282881934298721
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -2119927079750763960
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4926263574620742253,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "大自然のトレーニングで成果を上げている彼女のために、\nより効果的に力をつけられる場所を見つけてあげられたら――",
            "enText": "Since she seemed to be achieving greater results \nby training out in nature, I really wanted to find \nplaces which could build her skills more effectively――",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 2329917530448355615
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7931748655679926424,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そう考え、気合いを入れて見て回ったのだが。",
            "enText": "With that in mind, I focused on searching, but――",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6705496311151508623,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "恥ずかしいことに、森の中ですっかり迷ってしまった。\nスマホは圏外で連絡手段はない。どうすれば――",
            "enText": "Embarrassingly, I just ended up lost in the forest. My smartphone \nhad no signal so I couldn't contact anyone. What should I do――",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -8361200672032588047,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "気性の荒い野犬の群れ",
            "enName": "Pack of Wild Dogs",
            "jpText": "（グルルルルッ……）",
            "enText": "(Grrrrrrrrr……)",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（この声、まさか、野犬の群れ――！？）",
                    "enText": "(That sound……wild dogs――!?)",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5762309072813356201,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "なんだって！　トレーナーが帰ってきていない！？",
            "enText": "What did you say!? Trainer hasn't come back yet!?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 259,
                    "pathId": 1720033222177781056
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4120341350921685334,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同僚トレーナー",
            "enName": "Colleague Trainer",
            "jpText": "ああ。てっきり君と一緒にいるのかと思ったんだが……\n捜しに行ったほうがいいかもしれないな。",
            "enText": "Yeah. I thought for sure they were with you though…… \nIt might be better to start looking for them.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 228,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 306,
                    "pathId": 2084497586167958642
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1950493899770770395,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "それならアタシが行く！！　――……あっちだ！",
            "enText": "In that case, I'll be the one to go!! ――……That way!",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 136,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 8972934749104380541
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 2179193267057337031
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6729936315126864884,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同僚トレーナー",
            "enName": "Colleague Trainer",
            "jpText": "ええっ！？　あっちって……どうしてわかるんだ！？",
            "enText": "Eeh!? That way?……How do you know that!?",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 131,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 973371862208837098,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "わかるさ！\nトレーナーは――アタシの運命だから！！",
            "enText": "I just do! \nTrainer is――my Fate!!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 128,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 197,
                    "pathId": -377915555530654255
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5125927461525821830,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "初めて会ったときだって、『こっちだ！』って感じたんだ！\n今だって聞こえる！　間違うわけがない……！",
            "enText": "Even the first time I met them 『This way!』 is what I felt! \nEven now I can hear it! There's no way it's wrong……!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 238,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 282,
                    "pathId": -7865001040513201957
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7396751054521132434
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6542299737610125950,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "うおおおおおおおおっ！！　待ってろ、トレーナーっ！！",
            "enText": "Uwooooooooooh!! Just wait for me, Trainer!!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 179,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 137,
                    "pathId": 8519772269911557407
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1240113644789945021,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "気性の荒い野犬の群れ",
            "enName": "Pack of Wild Dogs",
            "jpText": "（フンフンフン……グルル……）",
            "enText": "(Sniff sniff……Grrr……)",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 64,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -2207103095488372970,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "じっとりと嫌な汗が頬を伝う。群れとの距離が縮まっているのは、\n気のせいではないだろう――獲物として、追い詰められている。",
            "enText": "A bead of sweat trickled down my cheek. It probably wasn't my imagination \nthat the pack was getting closer――they were tracking me like prey.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（――崖！？まずい、行き止まり――）",
                    "enText": "(――A cliff!? A dead end――)",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1630693928673827251,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――見つけたっ！！",
            "enText": "――Found you!!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -920750098330459093,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "思った通りだ！　やっぱりいたな、トレーナー！",
            "enText": "Just like I thought! You really are there, Trainer!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 130,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（エピ！？）",
                    "enText": "(Epi!?)",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": -5634482324500746599
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": -3991698404461119432
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3069913119690115732,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "崖の下から、聞き間違えようのない声が響いた。",
            "enText": "A familiar voice rang out from below the cliff.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 73,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": 7689694908564400942
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": 6896116066236979198
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6672562160188418884,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "どうしてここがわかったのか、なんて疑問は瞬時に吹き飛ばされる。\n『やっぱり』――彼女には聞こえたのだ。",
            "enText": "The question of how she found this place didn't even \ncross my mind. 『Of course』――It was her that I heard.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 7841457385846747022
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": 1968830872533161650
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1850967284986574096,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "待っていてくれ！　すぐにそっちに向かうからな！",
            "enText": "Just hold on! I'll be there soon!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 122,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（来ちゃだめだ……！こっちには野犬が！）",
                    "enText": "(Don't come here……! The dogs!)",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（来ちゃだめ……！こっちには野犬が！）",
                    "enText": "(Don't come here……! The dogs!)",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": -8580586136727418220
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6038220677266247411
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9171056004161285520,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "見つけてくれたのは嬉しいが、彼女を危険に晒すわけにはいかない。\n声を出せないので慌てて首を振り、手でバツ印を作る。",
            "enText": "I'm glad she found me, but I couldn't put her in danger. Since I \ncouldn't speak, I hurriedly shook my head and made an X with my hands.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": 9090734888318010230
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3290244206133702075,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "え？　ダメって、どうして――",
            "enText": "Eh? I can't? Why――",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 4987788895309331964
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": -3985605355334200996
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8544662235361085066,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "気性の荒い野犬の群れ",
            "enName": "Pack of Wild Dogs",
            "jpText": "（グルルルルッ！！）",
            "enText": "(Grrrrrrrr!!)",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ひっ……！",
                    "enText": "Hii……!",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": -5348800077639743461
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": -6841062362367044555
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7832087393122637436,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "！　なるほど、野犬の群れがいるのか……。\nそれなら――",
            "enText": "! I see, some wild dogs are nearby…… \nIn that case――",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 195,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 235,
                    "pathId": 5146863513559230944
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -442048693874781490
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7520649512297407021,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "選択肢はひとつだ！\nこっちに飛び降りてこい、トレーナー！　必ず受け止める！",
            "enText": "There's only one choice! \nJump down, Trainer! I'll catch you for sure!",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 224,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -6266781518660955509
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 244,
                    "pathId": -5379755787042620811
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7788396248870244552,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "大丈夫！\nアタシは――アタシの運命を手放したりしない！",
            "enText": "It's fine! \nI won't――Lose hold of my Fate!",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 170,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 4614985752697969488
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 189,
                    "pathId": -802305038957567100
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2201399587323077208,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "来い、トレーナー！　アタシのもとに！！",
            "enText": "Come, Trainer! To me!!",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -7439486478772148545
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": 8925796809610769677
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8071963730831255793,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "迷っている暇はない――いや、広げられた手に迷いは消えた。\n世界に運命が満ちるその日まで、ついていくと約束したのだ。",
            "enText": "I couldn't hesitate――No, all my hesitation vanished \nwhen she held out her arms. I promised to be with \nher until the day the world overflowed with Fate.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（俺は――エピを信じる！！）",
                    "enText": "(I believe in Epi!!)",
                    "nextBlock": 33
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（私は――エピを信じる！！）",
                    "enText": "(I believe in Epi!!)",
                    "nextBlock": 33
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": 916800620973042531
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": -7621472906769211563
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 757266457881475236,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "躊躇わずに地を蹴り、飛び込んでいく。\n――全てが、スローモーションに見えた。",
            "enText": "I ran and jumped off the cliff. \n――Everything seemed to move in slow motion.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": 8597388304994497363
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": -6035595158179420403
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6486760083508668552,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――つかまえた！",
            "enText": "――Got you!",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 55,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -2243899502727584415
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2487172442683123365
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6190697981523461138,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ケガはないか、トレーナー？",
            "enText": "You're not hurt are you, Trainer?",
            "nextBlock": 36,
